  "question": {
    "text": "A sample of hydrogen gas was collected over water at <math><mn>21</mn><mo>°</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> and 685 mm Hg. The volume of the container was 7.80 L. Calculate the mass of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></math> collected (vapour pressure of water = 18.6 mm Hg at <math><mn>21</mn><mo>°</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> )",
    "image": null
  },
